TEXT -464 -832 Left 2 ;K9 12 V: jack via L6 744222 CM choke (cable ground isolated) OR phantom feed up the RF OUT coax (VCF, D8); diode-OR D1/D8
TEXT -464 -800 Left 2 ;then PTC R9, 15 V TVS D2, 100u/1u LC (L7/C12), 22R/220u+100n RC (R1/C1/C2). Jack sim: VIN = 12 V at the jack
TEXT -464 -112 Left 2 ;RF IN (50 ohm connector). Fixture V1/RS and load RL are for simulation only.
TEXT -464 128 Left 2 ;Surge: GDT C11 (GDT25-09-S1-RP, 0.6 pF model) + 3x SP4022-01FTG-C to the rear ground post
TEXT 224 144 Left 2 ;VHF damping L1||R2 (~90 MHz)
TEXT 224 208 Left 2 ;Gate bias R3 100k; BAV99 clamp D6/D7 gate<->VSRC
TEXT 880 -400 Left 2 ;STAGE 1: 4x LSBF862 common source
